## 🚀 Autonomous Skill Retrieval & Invocation Protocol (全自动技能检索与调用协议)
The agent operates in full **Auto-Retrieve & Auto-Invoke** mode:
1. **Intent Analysis & Skill Matching**: Upon receiving ANY user request, automatically evaluate which design & engineering domain it belongs to:
   - High-impact aesthetic / layout / anti-slop -> Auto-invoke `01-frontend-design.md`
   - Spacing / typography scale / color contrast -> Auto-invoke `02-better-ui-typography-colors.md`
   - UX flow / visual hierarchy / state feedback -> Auto-invoke `03-cursor-designer.md`
   - Animation / physics / micro-interactions -> Auto-invoke `04-premium-frontend-motion.md`
   - React architecture / TypeScript / clean styling -> Auto-invoke `05-awesome-cursorrules-modern-stack.md`
2. **External Skill Discovery (Web/GitHub)**: If the user request touches on novel interactive techniques or specialized libraries (e.g., custom WebGL shaders, Three.js spatial scenes, GSAP flip animations), automatically retrieve high-star implementations via `search_web` without asking the user.
3. **Zero Overhead for User**: The user NEVER needs to memorize skill names. Speak naturally, and the agent will silently match, retrieve, and execute the highest standard.

